# Store page for {{.Title}}

| File | What it is |
|---|---|
| `template.md` | The text of your store page (Markdown). Each `## ` heading is a section. |
| `page.json` | The JSON template: game details (tagline, category, tags), media files, and which sections show, in what order. |
| `page.schema.json` | Lets your editor check and autocomplete `page.json`. |

Put images and the trailer in this folder and name them in `page.json` under `media`.

| Media | Format | Limits |
|---|---|---|
| banner | PNG, JPEG, WebP | at least 960x300, 2:1 or wider, 4 MiB |
| cover | PNG, JPEG, WebP | at least 460x215, 2 MiB |
| screenshots (up to 8) | PNG, JPEG, WebP | at least 640x360, 4 MiB each |
| video | MP4 or WebM | 30 MiB |

Check everything without uploading: `vapour store check`.
Update only the store page: `vapour store push`.
Publish a new version with the page and your build: `vapour publish --version 0.1.0 --notes "First release"`.
Each version can be published once, so pass a new `--version` each release. You can use `--notes-file notes.md` instead of `--notes`.

Players see only published games.
